    {
      "id": "u_34ab21aa511d47e82c9db44e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "On Linux, Trilium is also available on __TRILIUM_PH_0__Flathub__TRILIUM_PH_1__, for both x86_64 and ARM (aarch64). Install it from your software center (e.g. GNOME Software or KDE Discover), or from a terminal:",
      "sourceHash": "34ab21aa511d47e82c9db44e7209c0bcc2c47dfa903ce29ba270367fccbda3fe",
      "context": "Desktop Installation > Installing from Flathub",
      "contextHash": "13c5db73455d81ac4c67b5af526873d308e4a1b24af2e8e9e448b5bd4d55ff50",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Linux では、Trilium は x86_64 および ARM (aarch64) の両方で __TRILIUM_PH_0__Flathub__TRILIUM_PH_1__ からも入手できます。ソフトウェアセンター (GNOME Software や KDE Discover など) またはターミナルからインストールします:",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9ee0bd07b343aa5ee6078adf_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Updates arrive through the software center or __TRILIUM_PH_0__, like any other Flatpak.",
      "sourceHash": "9ee0bd07b343aa5ee6078adf8863382ebe67f62c20f3c33a6786f060f283b560",
      "context": "Desktop Installation > Installing from Flathub",
      "contextHash": "13c5db73455d81ac4c67b5af526873d308e4a1b24af2e8e9e448b5bd4d55ff50",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "他の Flatpak と同様に、アップデートはソフトウェアセンターまたは __TRILIUM_PH_0__ を通じて提供されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7fb11946775810eca092f475_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The Flathub version runs in a sandbox and keeps its __TRILIUM_PH_0__data directory__TRILIUM_PH_1__ in __TRILIUM_PH_2__. It cannot see the data directory of a __TRILIUM_PH_3__, __TRILIUM_PH_4__, AppImage or __TRILIUM_PH_5__ installation (__TRILIUM_PH_6__), so it starts with an empty database. To bring existing notes over:",
      "sourceHash": "7fb11946775810eca092f475f437be5e79d52dd05762b2dbf63fec3cb7d17fa0",
      "context": "Desktop Installation > Installing from Flathub",
      "contextHash": "13c5db73455d81ac4c67b5af526873d308e4a1b24af2e8e9e448b5bd4d55ff50",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Flathub 版はサンドボックス内で実行され、__TRILIUM_PH_0__データディレクトリ__TRILIUM_PH_1__ を __TRILIUM_PH_2__ に保持します。__TRILIUM_PH_3__、__TRILIUM_PH_4__、AppImage、または __TRILIUM_PH_5__ のインストールにおけるデータディレクトリ (__TRILIUM_PH_6__) は参照できないため、空のデータベースで起動します。既存のノートを引き継ぐには:",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
