    {
      "id": "u_e987fc2370e93e6be031c526_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The sandbox also hides the command-line tools that the __TRILIUM_PH_0__subscription-based AI providers__TRILIUM_PH_1__ run (Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, OpenAI Codex, Google Antigravity); that page describes the permission that lets the Flatpak start them.",
      "sourceHash": "e987fc2370e93e6be031c526cdaed53576fdd52f6b0feaa6f8fa3052fabe2f7d",
      "context": "Desktop Installation > Installing from Flathub",
      "contextHash": "13c5db73455d81ac4c67b5af526873d308e4a1b24af2e8e9e448b5bd4d55ff50",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "また、サンドボックスは __TRILIUM_PH_0__サブスクリプションベースのAIプロバイダー__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (Claude Code、GitHub Copilot、OpenAI Codex、Google Antigravity) が実行するコマンドラインツールも隠蔽します。そのページでは、Flatpak がそれらを起動できるようにする権限について説明しています。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
