    {
      "id": "u_62c99ab0d37e191a569bf18e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__: Starts Trilium without validating __TRILIUM_PH_1__TLS certificates__TRILIUM_PH_2__, useful if connecting to a server with a self-signed certificate.",
      "sourceHash": "62c99ab0d37e191a569bf18e0198d3eed41fb0d02914f7852aef03a7fa907af5",
      "context": "Desktop Installation > Startup Scripts",
      "contextHash": "03dc02339532b43f004aa96526e4851fb0619029659b986443f475ce1ddadb0a",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__: __TRILIUM_PH_1__TLS証明書__TRILIUM_PH_2__の検証を行わずにTriliumを起動します。自己署名証明書を使用するサーバーに接続する場合に便利です。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
