    },
    {
      "id": "u_e635b9c69dccb70931aab35c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__: Launches Trilium in portable mode, where the __TRILIUM_PH_1__data directory__TRILIUM_PH_2__ is created within the application's directory, making it easy to move the entire setup. Electron's internal data (caches, dictionaries, etc.) is also stored within the data directory, so no files are written to the system's roaming profile.",
      "sourceHash": "e635b9c69dccb70931aab35cb4d056f92fd9a3e27094e82030344cafa6dd4832",
      "context": "Desktop Installation > Startup Scripts",
      "contextHash": "03dc02339532b43f004aa96526e4851fb0619029659b986443f475ce1ddadb0a",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__: ポータブルモードでTriliumを起動します。__TRILIUM_PH_1__データディレクトリ__TRILIUM_PH_2__がアプリケーションのディレクトリ内に作成されるため、設定全体を簡単に移動させることができます。Electronの内部データ（キャッシュ、辞書など）もデータディレクトリ内に保存されるため、システムのローミングプロファイルにはファイルが書き込まれません。",
      "conditions": {
